{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tell me more about my business operations as per right now","role":"user"},{"content":"**🗂️ Current Product Inventory Snapshot**\n\n| ID | Product Name | Stock Qty | Sell Price (KES) | Buy Price (KES) | Profit per Unit (KES) | Margin % |\n|----|--------------|----------|------------------|----------------|-----------------------|----------|\n| 1  | Product 1_1  | 100      | 600              | 400            | 200                   | 33.33 % |\n| 2  | Product 1_2  | 100      | 700              | 500            | 200                   | 28.57 % |\n| 3  | Product 2_1  | 100      | 600              | 400            | 200                   | 33.33 % |\n| 4  | Product 2_2  | 100      | 700              | 500            | 200                   | 28.57 % |\n| 5  | Product 3_1  | 100      | 600              | 400            | 200                   | 33.33 % |\n| 6  | Product 3_2  | 100      | 700              | 500            | 200                   | 28.57 % |\n| 7  | Product 4_1  | 100      | 600              | 400            | 200                   | 33.33 % |\n| 8  | Product 4_2  | 100      | 700              | 500            | 200                   | 28.57 % |\n| 9  | Product 5_1  | 100      | 600              | 400            | 200                   | 33.33 % |\n| 10 | Product 5_2  | 100      | 700              | 500            | 200                   | 28.57 % |\n| 11 | Dairy Meal   | 100      | 3,000            | 2,400          | 600                   | 20.00 % |\n| 12 | Chicken Mesh | 200      | 1,200            | 960            | 240                   | 20.00 % |\n\n**Key Take‑aways**\n\n- **Low‑stock alert:** All items have a stock quantity ≥ 100, so none are currently below the “low‑stock” threshold ( < 5 ). No immediate restocking urgency.\n- **Total inventory value:** If you sold every unit at the listed price, the gross inventory value would be **≈ KES 1,190,000**.\n- **Profit potential:**  \n  - Most products yield a **33 %** margin (≈ KES 200 per unit).  \n  - The two specialty items (Dairy Meal & Chicken Mesh) have lower margins (~20 %) but higher absolute profit per unit.\n- **Opportunity:** Since the majority of your margin comes from the 33 %‑margin items, consider promotional pushes on those to boost profitability further.\n\n---\n\n### What would you like to explore next?\n\n- **Customer overview** – see who’s already registered and any details (email, phone).  \n- **Order status** – view pending/created orders and identify any that need payment action.  \n- **Sales summary** – get a quick report of recent revenue and top‑selling items.  \n\nJust let me know which area you’d like to dive into, and I’ll pull the relevant data for you. 🚀","role":"assistant"}],"message":"Provide a sales summary"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-18T08:43:55.093Z"}
